---
description: GOV.UK content design and UI writing
globs:
  - "**/*.njk"
  - "**/content/**"
  - "**/*.md"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Sentence case, no ampersands, ISO dates ("24 April 2025").
- Active voice, address the user as "you", one idea per sentence, front-load key information.
- Error messages: what happened + what to do next.
- Adapt tone to the audience set in project context (internal = concise, domain terms OK; public = plain language, no assumed knowledge).
- For user-facing copy, prefer the gov-content-designer sub-agent.

Full conventions: @docs/standards/content.md
